- rhea_mercer: Null-Value Token (held, hand_left), Obsidian Shard (stowed, blazer_pocket_left), Administrative Coordinate Chip (stowed, blazer_pocket_left), Raw Data Packet (stowed, system_inventory)
- vance_harrow: Rebar (held, hand_right), Copper Credits (stowed, torn_pocket)

